Description:

JMAP EmailSubmission/set now enforces jmap_max_delayed_send.  A HOLDFOR
or HOLDUNTIL parameter beyond the limit is rejected with
invalidProperties.


Documentation:

The jmap_max_delayed_send option in imapd.conf(5).


Config changes:

jmap_max_delayed_send is now enforced, not just advertised.


Upgrade instructions:

Check jmap_max_delayed_send (default 512d) covers the longest delayed send
your clients schedule.


GitHub issue:

None.
